SUMMARY:Vermont: State corporate income/franchise tax return due
DESCRIPTION:Form CO-411 due April 15. Vermont's extended due date is 30 day
 s beyond the federal extended due date (federal extends to October 15\, 202
 6\, so Vermont's computed extended date is November 14\, 2026) - confirmed 
 directly against the CO-411 instructions\, which state the offset rule rath
 er than a fixed calendar date. | Form CO-411 due April 15. Vermont's extend
 ed due date is 30 days beyond the federal extended due date (federal extend
